# 副簽
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:書面上面嘅第二個簽名，通常係由第二個人簽，或者係主簽人嘅代表簽名（量詞：個）
eng:co-signature / second signature
<eg>
yue:呢份文件要我同埋我嘅上級都要簽，所以我嘅簽名就係副簽。 (goi1 fan1 man4 ji5 ngo5 tung4 oi3 ngo5 ge3 soeng5 noek6 dou1 jiu3 zing1, so2 ji5 ngo5 ge3 zing1 meng4 zau6 hai6 fu1 zing1.)
eng:This document needs to be signed by both me and my supervisor, so my signature is the co-signature.

yue:銀行要求貸款人要有一個副簽，唔然唔會批准。 (gin1 hong1 jiu3 kau1 toi3 kui3 jan4 jiu3 jau5 jat1 go3 fu1 zing1, m4 jin4 m4 wui5 pui3 zeon2.)
eng:The bank requires the borrower to have a co-signer, otherwise it won't approve the loan. [end of text]


